'''Saber Alter''' (セイバーオルタ) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Saber Alter
|image = E 441.png
|appearance = [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 3,000¢ - 11,850¢
}}

==Enemy==
Saber Alter is an enemy that has massive health, a Lv.3 [[Wave Attack]] and a powerful [[Omni Strike]]. Her base damage is fairly moderate, but with the wave, it jumps up to 16,000 damage, which is quite a formidable number for her fast attack rate and movement speed. Her weaknesses are her large knockback count and fairly low base range.

==Strategy==
[[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] is recommended to be used against her, as Octopus can block the waves she creates. Otherwise, tankers like [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Cleanerbot Cat]] or [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] are ideal; or [[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|anti-Traitless cats]] such as [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Supercat]], who is able to both block her waves and [[Weaken|weaken]] her.

